Conceptual fields:

```text
acceptance_criteria_id
goal_id
version
criterion_type
criterion_text
required
evaluator_ref optional
created_at
```

Final acceptance must resolve the exact criteria version used.

---

# 18. Execution Proposal / Plan

Plan data is immutable or versioned after admission.

Conceptual fields:

```text
proposal_id
goal_id
plan_version
graph_hash
task_ids
topological_order
created_by
created_at
admission_state
```

If the plan materially changes:

```text
new plan version
+ evidence
+ re-admission
```

